  "name": "2024_online_addiction_sabas",
  "description": "Smartphone Application-BasedAddiction. Item response data in the Item Response Warehouse (IRW), a harmonised collection of item-level response data for psychometric research. 6,648 responses from 1,108 respondents to 6 items. Classified as: Child (<18y); Child (6-12y); Educational; Affective/mental health, Behavioral; Survey/questionnaire; Likert Scale/selected response; chi; Smartphone Application-BasedAddiction.",
  "url": "https://itemresponsewarehouse.org/tables/2024_online_addiction_sabas/",
  "version": "340.0.0",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-04",
  "license": "See the IRW record for licence terms.",
  "citation": "Jiaping Ma, Shu An, Qian Chen et al. Assessing Online-Related Addiction in Chinese Primary School Students: An Item Response Theory Analysis of Three Scales, 04 May 2026, PREPRINT (Version 1) available at Research Square",
  "citeAs": "Jiaping Ma, Shu An, Qian Chen et al. Assessing Online-Related Addiction in Chinese Primary School Students: An Item Response Theory Analysis of Three Scales, 04 May 2026, PREPRINT (Version 1) available at Research Square",
